---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<!-- ============ PEOPLE ============ -->
<section id="partners" class="py-16" style="background:#f5f9f1">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 reveal">
      <div class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-deep mb-3" data-en="Who We Work With" data-zh="合作伙伴">Who We Work With</div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-3" data-en="Partners" data-zh="合作伙伴">Partners</h2>
      <p class="text-muted max-w-2xl mx-auto text-sm mt-4" data-en="We build alongside the researchers and networks who defined these questions." data-zh="我们与定义了这些问题的研究者与网络并肩构建。">We build alongside the researchers and networks who defined these questions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-8">
      <div class="partner-card rounded-xl p-5 text-center reveal hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow flex flex-col">
        <div class="partner-logo"><img src={`${base}/partner-logos/mit-media-lab.svg`} alt="MIT Media Lab logo"></div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm">MIT Media Lab</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 flex-1" data-en="Pioneering the Fab Lab network and Interspecies Internet initiative." data-zh="开创 Fab Lab 网络与跨物种互联网倡议。">Pioneering the Fab Lab network and Interspecies Internet initiative.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="partner-card rounded-xl p-5 text-center reveal hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow flex flex-col">
        <div class="partner-logo"><img src={`${base}/partner-logos/interspecies-internet.png`} alt="Interspecies Internet logo"></div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm">Interspecies Internet</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 flex-1" data-en="The global hub for interspecies communication — bridging science, ethics, and culture." data-zh="跨物种交流的全球枢纽——连接科学、伦理与文化。">The global hub for interspecies communication — bridging science, ethics, and culture.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="partner-card rounded-xl p-5 text-center reveal hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow flex flex-col">
        <div class="partner-logo"><img src={`${base}/partner-logos/fab-lab-network.svg`} alt="Fab Lab Network logo"></div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm">Fab Lab Network</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 flex-1" data-en="Global network of digital fabrication laboratories." data-zh="全球数制制造实验室网络。">Global network of digital fabrication laboratories.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="partner-card rounded-xl p-5 text-center reveal hover:shadow-card-hover transition-shadow flex flex-col">
        <div class="partner-logo"><img src={`${base}/partner-logos/dina-lab.png`} alt="Dina Lab logo"></div>
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-sm">Dina Lab</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted mt-1 flex-1" data-en="Creator of the Mothbox open-source insect trap cam." data-zh="Mothbox 开源昆虫诱捕摄像头创建者。">Creator of the Mothbox open-source insect trap cam.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
